	<div id="j-multi" class="t" style="left: 10px; top: 10px; width: 300px;">The caravan reached the old bridge at dusk, and the guards waved it through without asking for papers.</div>
	<div id="j-span" class="t" style="left: 330px; top: 10px; width: 300px;">The caravan reached the <span class="pad">old bridge at dusk, and the</span> guards waved it through without asking for papers.</div>
